---
description: Chessboard, heatmap overlays, and canvas mode conventions
globs: src/features/chessboard/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Heatmap and board work must stay aligned with Endgame post-game study plans.

- Centralise overlay state: `src/features/chessboard/state/heatmapSettingsContext.tsx`
- Register schemes: `src/features/chessboard/overlays/schemes/registry.ts`
- Register colour profiles: `src/features/chessboard/overlays/colors/registry.ts`
- Terminal heatmap commands: update help when behaviour changes

Reference docs:
- `docs/development-insights/heatmap-overlays.md`
- `docs/project-visions/normalized-board-phase-two.md`
- `docs/plans/expanded-canvas-mode.md`

Live play (`src/features/endgame/`) consumes board components; do not embed match logic in chessboard feature.
